From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: route zoom keys through ShellModel

The GTK4 application object does not expose set_zoom_level; that API belongs
to ShellModel.  The resulting AttributeError was swallowed by GTK's signal
dispatcher, making F1-F4 appear to do nothing.  Route the top-level key
controller through the authoritative model, matching semantic D-Bus actions.

--- a/src/jarabe/main.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/main.py
@@ -334,1 +334,1 @@
-            shell_instance.set_zoom_level(level)
+            shell_instance.get_model().set_zoom_level(level)
